From fa06bb2829067070da12901bdc612e971b574b0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick Alonso <nick@drkm.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:10:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] metal : add GGML_OP_FLASH_ATTN_EXT_BANDED

The banded relative-position bias as a second additive score term in the
three flash attention kernel families (half8x8, tensor API, vec): one more
buffer (the bias table), function constants has_rel/rel_type, kargs for the
table extents and the query offset. Host: dispatch, pipeline getters,
supports_op, scratch sizing.

Assisted-by: Claude Fable 5.1
